Ooops!  It must have been past my bedtime when I sent the last message as I forgot to include the covariances in the calculation of the standard error of the mean.

The line

  psi.mean.se <http://psi.mean.se/> <- sqrt(sum(diag(covmat)[1:k]))/k
  # [1] 0.01286833

should be

  psi.mean.se <http://psi.mean.se> <- sqrt(sum(covmat[1:k, 1:k]))/k
  # [1] 0.01287939

There isn't much difference from the previous result as the covariances are all positive but small in this example.

Jim

